  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The diagram shows how a rectangular coil moves through a magnetic field. The direction of the field is into the page. A current is induced in the coil as it enters and leaves the field. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the direction of the electron flow between point S and point T as the coil is entering and leaving the field?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction of electron flow as the coil is entering the field</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction of electron flow as the coil is leaving the field</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Upwards</td>\n<td>Downwards</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Downwards</td>\n<td>Downwards</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Upwards</td>\n<td>Upwards</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Downwards</td>\n<td>Upwards</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
